  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Business Innovation and Entrepreneurship Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Innovacin Empresarial y Emprendimiento II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es aumentar la inversin pblica y privada en actividades de investigacin e innovacin. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) aumentar la oferta de conocimiento aplicado orientado a desafos productivos y sociales; (ii) incrementar la disponibilidad de financiamiento para la innovacin empresarial; y (iii) fortalecer las capacidades institucionales de la ANII. El programa es la segunda operacin individual bajo la CCLIP aprobada por el Directorio Ejecutivo a travs de la Resolucin DE-5817</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to increase public and private investment in research and innovation activities. The specific objectives are to: (i) expand the supply of applied knowledge geared toward productive and social challenges; (ii) increase the availability of financing for business innovation; and (iii) strengthen ANII&apos;s institutional capacities. The program is the second individual operation under the CCLIP, approved by the Board of Executive Directors via Resolution DE-5817.</narrative>
  </description>
